            > <div class="p-tab-content-container-bottom"></div> <nav class="p-clearfix   p-button-placement-top    
                  p-gc05v3-expander p-row-gutter"
                
                > <ul class="p-tab-container p-gc05v3-harmonica-without-border   p-accordion-transparency"> <li class="p-selected p-xs-one-whole p-s-one-whole  "> <a data-track-type="track-conversion" data-track-name="interaction" data-track-description="tab:slide_1:gc05v3-tabcontainer" data-track-compid="gc05v3-tabcontainer" data-tab-name="slide_1" name="slide_1" href="#" class="p-tab-switcher " data-tabcounter="1"> <div class="p-tab-title">Opening times </div> <i class="p-tab-expander-icon p-accordion-arrow p-icon-down"></i> </a> <div class="p-tab-content  
                                      
                                      
                                       p-tab-content-counter-1"> <span class="p-print-show p-hidden">Opening times</span> <div class="1 tc01v2-backgroundparsys component-base"> <section data-comp-id="tc01BackgroundParsys"
            data-background='{}'
            style=""
            aria-label=""
            class="p-tc01-backgroundparsys   p-cell-gutter       "> <div class="containerpar parsys"><div class="gc11v3-generictext component-base section"> <section
        class="p-gc11v3-generictext p-valign-parent
               
            p-row-gutter "
        id="gc11v3-vH8lj0yoAnkHSxmU"
        data-comp-id="gc11v3Generictext"
        data-containerlink='{"useLink":"no",
                "url":"",
                "navdest":"",
                "target":"_self",
                "omniture":""}'
        data-is-internal="true"> <div class="p-vertical-positioning p-text-container  p-valign-top"> <div class="p-text-container-inner"> <p class="p-body-text p-text-smaller
                        p-l-col1 p-m-col1
                        p-s-col1 p-xs-col1"> <span><ul class="p-bullets"> <li><span class="p-body-copy-02">Tuesday to Sunday 11:00 AM – 05:00 PM</span></li> <li><span class="p-body-copy-02">During Dutch Design Week we are open every day from 11:00 AM - 06:00 PM</span></li> <li><span class="p-body-copy-02">During all Dutch school holidays also open on Mondays.&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p style="font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</p> <p style="font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><strong><span class="p-body-copy-02">Alternative opening times</span></strong></p> <ul class="p-bullets"> <li>We are open for visitors on Ascension Day and both days of Pentecost.</li> <li><span class="p-body-copy-02">On 24 December and 31 December the museum will close at 15:00.&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p style="font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><span class="p-body-copy-02">&nbsp;</span></p> <p style="font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><span class="p-body-copy-02"><strong>The museum is closed on:</strong></span></p> <ul class="p-bullets"> <li style="font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><span class="p-body-copy-02">December 25 and 26 (Christmas)</span></li> <li style="font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><span class="p-body-copy-02">January 1 (New Years Day)<br> </span></li> <li style="font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><span class="p-body-copy-02">April 27 (Kings Day)</span></li> </ul></span> </p> </div> </div> </section> </div> </div> </section> </div> </div> </li> <li class=" p-xs-one-whole p-s-one-whole  "> <a data-track-type="track-conversion" data-track-name="interaction" data-track-description="tab:slide_2:gc05v3-tabcontainer" data-track-compid="gc05v3-tabcontainer" data-tab-name="slide_2" name="slide_2" href="#" class="p-tab-switcher " data-tabcounter="2"> <div class="p-tab-title">Address & Directions </div> <i class="p-tab-expander-icon p-accordion-arrow p-icon-down"></i> </a> <div class="p-tab-content p-gc05v3-hidden 
                                      
                                      
                                       p-tab-content-counter-2"> <span class="p-print-show p-hidden">Address & Directions</span> <div class="2 tc01v2-backgroundparsys component-base"> <section data-comp-id="tc01BackgroundParsys"
            data-background='{}'
            style=""
            aria-label=""
            class="p-tc01-backgroundparsys   p-cell-gutter       "> <div class="containerpar parsys"><div class="gc11v3-generictext component-base section"> <section
        class="p-gc11v3-generictext p-valign-parent
               
            p-row-gutter  p-l-spacing-top-c p-m-spacing-top-c p-s-spacing-top-c p-xs-spacing-top-c"
        id="gc11v3-zmbTzCrytTk2kmjs"
        data-comp-id="gc11v3Generictext"
        data-containerlink='{"useLink":"no",
                "url":"",
                "navdest":"",
                "target":"_self",
                "omniture":""}'
        data-is-internal="true"> <div class="p-vertical-positioning p-text-container  p-valign-top"> <div class="p-text-container-inner"> <h3><span class="p-heading-03">Address</span></h3> <p class="p-body-text p-text-smaller
                        p-l-col1 p-m-col1
                        p-s-col1 p-xs-col1"> <span><p><span class="p-body-copy-02"><strong><br> Philips Museum</strong></span></p> <p><span class="p-body-copy-02">Emmasingel 31<br> 5611 AZ Eindhoven</span></p> <p><span class="p-body-copy-02">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span class="p-body-copy-02">Phone (general reception): +31 (0)40 235 90 30<br> Phone (Bookings and Sales): +31 (0)6 - 29 12 30 86<br> </span></p></span> </p> </div> </div> </section> </div> <div class="gc11v3-generictext component-base section"> <section
        class="p-gc11v3-generictext p-valign-parent
               
            p-row-gutter  p-l-spacing-top-c p-m-spacing-top-c p-s-spacing-top-b p-xs-spacing-top-b"
        id="gc11v3-qsOSmTuViyZRTMb2"
        data-comp-id="gc11v3Generictext"
        data-containerlink='{"useLink":"no",
                "url":"",
                "navdest":"",
                "target":"_top",
                "omniture":""}'
        data-is-internal="true"> <div class="p-vertical-positioning p-text-container  p-valign-top"> <div class="p-text-container-inner"> <h2><span class="p-heading-03">Directions</span></h2> <p class="p-body-text p-text-smaller
                        p-l-col1 p-m-col1
                        p-s-col1 p-xs-col1"> <span><p><br> &nbsp;</p> <p><span class="p-body-copy-02">We advise visitors to come to the museum by bike, if possible. The Philips Museum is also accessible by various public transport links.</span></p> <p><span class="p-body-copy-02"><strong>Bicycle<br> &nbsp;</strong></span></p> <p><span class="p-body-copy-02">At the Emmasingel, located on the north side of the museum, there are plenty of bike racks to park your bike. Additionally there is a guarded parking space on the 18 Septemberplein. From there it's a 5 minute walk to the museum. From the central station you can bike to the museum in 5 minutes as well. There are OV-bikes available for rent at the station.</span></p> <p><span class="p-body-copy-02"><br> <strong>Public transport</strong></span></p> <p><span class="p-body-copy-02">The Philips Museum is just a 10-minute walk from the central railway station in Eindhoven. There is also a good bus service to the museum; alight at the ‘Piazza’ or ‘Vrijstraat’ stop.<br> Plan je reis via:&nbsp;<a href="https://9292.nl/" target="_blank" data-track-description="www_9292_nl" data-track-type="track-conversion" data-track-name="interaction" data-track-compid="gc11" class="p-gc11v3-inlinelink" rel="noopener">www.9292.nl</a></span></p> <p><span class="p-body-copy-02"><br> <strong>Parking</strong></span></p> <p><span class="p-body-copy-02">Paid parking is available in the vicinity of the Philips Museum. You can also park in the parking garages Admirant, Mathildelaan, or Witte Dame. Furthermore there is the option to make use of the <a href="https://www.eindhoven.nl/stad-en-wonen/stad/parkeren-en-reizen-pr" target="_blank" data-track-description="P_R_locations" data-track-type="track-conversion" data-track-name="interaction" data-track-compid="gc11" class="p-gc11v3-inlinelink" rel="noopener">P+R locations</a> including Meerhoven and the Genneper Parken.<br> <br> <br> <strong>Coaches</strong><br> Passengers are only permitted to board/alight from coaches in the right-hand lane of the Emmasingel. Coaches are permitted to park (temporarily) in the Meerhoven P&amp;R car park, on the parallel road to the south of Onze Lieve Vrouwestraat, between the John F. Kennedylaan and the river Dommel and on the service road to the south of the Professor Dr. Dorgelolaan.</span></p></span> </p> </div> </div> </section> </div> </div> </section> </div> </div> </li> <li class=" p-xs-one-whole p-s-one-whole  "> <a data-track-type="track-conversion" data-track-name="interaction" data-track-description="tab:slide_3:gc05v3-tabcontainer" data-track-compid="gc05v3-tabcontainer" data-tab-name="slide_3" name="slide_3" href="#" class="p-tab-switcher " data-tabcounter="3"> <div class="p-tab-title">Accessibility </div> <i class="p-tab-expander-icon p-accordion-arrow p-icon-down"></i> </a> <div class="p-tab-content p-gc05v3-hidden 
                                      
                                      
                                       p-tab-content-counter-3"> <span class="p-print-show p-hidden">Accessibility</span> <div class="3 tc01v2-backgroundparsys component-base"> <section data-comp-id="tc01BackgroundParsys"
            data-background='{}'
            style=""
            aria-label=""
            class="p-tc01-backgroundparsys   p-cell-gutter       "> <div class="containerpar parsys"><div class="gc11v3-generictext component-base section"> <section
        class="p-gc11v3-generictext p-valign-parent
               
            p-row-gutter  p-l-spacing-top-c p-m-spacing-top-c p-s-spacing-top-b p-xs-spacing-top-b"
        id="gc11v3-cNpUPhpEI6lzgpuM"
        data-comp-id="gc11v3Generictext"
        data-containerlink='{"useLink":"no",
                "url":"",
                "navdest":"",
                "target":"_self",
                "omniture":""}'
        data-is-internal="true"> <div class="p-vertical-positioning p-text-container  p-valign-top"> <div class="p-text-container-inner"> <p class="p-body-text p-text-smaller
                        p-l-col1 p-m-col1
                        p-s-col1 p-xs-col1"> <span><p><span class="p-body-copy-02">The Philips Museum has full disability acces.&nbsp;A disabled toilet is available and we have a lift.&nbsp;Also guide dogs are allowed to enter if necessary.</span></p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <ul class="p-bullets"> <li><span class="p-body-copy-02">The museum is also suitable for wheelchair users and there is a lift.&nbsp;There is a wheelchair available in the Philips Museum.&nbsp;If you wish to use the wheelchair, please reserve it in advance by calling +31 (0)40 235 90 30.</span></li> </ul> <ul class="p-bullets"> <li><span class="p-body-copy-02">Companions with a companion pass or autipass don't have to buy an entrance ticket.<br> </span></li> <li><span class="p-body-copy-02">An audio tour is free with your entrance ticket and available in Dutch, Dutch in Easy Language, English, German, French, Turkish, Spanish and Italian.</span></li> </ul> <ul class="p-bullets"> <li><span class="p-body-copy-02">Live tours can be booked online in Dutch, English and German. For other languages or special requests, please send an email to <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="c8aaa7ada3a1a6afada6e5a5bdbbadbda588b8a0a1a4a1b8bbe6aba7a5">[email&#160;protected]</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><span class="p-body-copy-02">To accommodate people who are unable to visit the museum, such as due to health or transportation issues, we offer the "Philips Museum Comes to You" program. This service is aimed at nursing and care centers.</span></p></span> </p> </div> </div> </section> </div> <div class="gc15-linkbutton component-base section"> <div class="p-gc15-link-button  p-row-gutter p-comp-spacing-top p-comp-spacing-bottom " data-is-internal="" data-crm-enabled="no" data-comp-id="gc15LinkButton"> <!--googleoff: anchor--> <a href="https://www.philips.nl/en/a-w/philips-museum/business.html#slide_coming-to-you" class="p-cta-link  p-l-icon-pos-left p-m-icon-pos-left p-s-icon-pos-left p-xs-icon-pos-left pv-button   gc15-linkbutton-component p-gc15-anchor-link " target="_self" title="The Philips Museum comes to you (opens in the same window)" rel="" data-track-type="track-conversion" data-track-name="interaction" data-track-description="visit_comes_to_you:button" data-track-compid="gc15" data-fullscreen-slide="none" data-btn-alignment='{"l":"left",
                                 "m":"left",
                                 "s":"left",
                                 "xs":"left"}'> <span class="p-gc15-info "> The Philips Museum comes to you </span> </a> <!--googleon: anchor--> </div> </div> </div> </section> </div> </div> </li> <li class=" p-xs-one-whole p-s-one-whole  "> <a data-track-type="track-conversion" data-track-name="interaction" data-track-description="tab:slide_4:gc05v3-tabcontainer" data-track-compid="gc05v3-tabcontainer" data-tab-name="slide_4" name="slide_4" href="#" class="p-tab-switcher " data-tabcounter="4"> <div class="p-tab-title">Museum cafe </div> <i class="p-tab-expander-icon p-accordion-arrow p-icon-down"></i> </a> <div class="p-tab-content p-gc05v3-hidden 
                                      
                                      
                                       p-tab-content-counter-4"> <span class="p-print-show p-hidden">Museum cafe</span> <div class="4 tc01v2-backgroundparsys component-base"> <section data-comp-id="tc01BackgroundParsys"
            data-background='{}'
            style=""
            aria-label=""
            class="p-tc01-backgroundparsys   p-cell-gutter       "> <div class="containerpar parsys"><div class="gc11v3-generictext component-base section"> <section
        class="p-gc11v3-generictext p-valign-parent
               
            p-row-gutter p-comp-spacing-bottom "
        id="gc11v3-f2dkCunh11caZNK4"
        data-comp-id="gc11v3Generictext"
        data-containerlink='{"useLink":"no",
                "url":"",
                "navdest":"",
                "target":"_self",
                "omniture":""}'
        data-is-internal="true"> <div class="p-vertical-positioning p-text-container  p-valign-top"> <div class="p-text-container-inner"> <p class="p-body-text p-text-smaller
                        p-l-col1 p-m-col1
                        p-s-col1 p-xs-col1"> <span><p>In the museum café we serve coffee, tea, soft drinks and fruit juice from the Philips Orchard throughout the day. You can also grab a bite to eat here. Our menu includes a range of sweet and savory snacks, from delicious apple pie to a real Brabant-style sausage roll. At lunchtime you’ll find a selection of healthy filled rolls, tuna salad and a variety of toasted sandwiches. Our museum café is open during museum&nbsp;opening hours.</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>The museum café can be hired for private parties and groups outside the museum opening hours. Click&nbsp;<a href="https://www.philips.nl/en/a-w/philips-museum/business.html" data-track-description="here" data-track-type="track-conversion" data-track-name="interaction" data-track-compid="gc11" class="p-gc11v3-inlinelink">here</a>&nbsp;for further details.</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><em>It is not allowed to consume self-brought food in the museum.</em></p></span> </p> </div> </div> </section> </div> <div class="gc15-linkbutton component-base section"> <div class="p-gc15-link-button  p-row-gutter p-comp-spacing-bottom " data-is-internal="" data-crm-enabled="no" data-comp-id="gc15LinkButton"> <!--googleoff: anchor--> <a href="https://www.philips.com/c-dam/corporate/philips-museum/Bezoek/museum-cafe/Menukaart-A5-maart2024-v4.pdf" class="p-cta-link  p-l-icon-pos-left p-m-icon-pos-left p-s-icon-pos-left p-xs-icon-pos-left pv-button   gc15-linkbutton-component p-gc15-anchor-link " target="_blank" title="Menu (opens in a new window)" rel="noopener" data-track-type="track-conversion" data-track-name="interaction" data-track-description="menu_philips_museum:button" data-track-compid="gc15" data-fullscreen-slide="none" data-btn-alignment='{"l":"left",
                                 "m":"left",
                                 "s":"left",
                                 "xs":"left"}'> <span class="p-gc15-info "> Menu </span> </a> <!--googleon: anchor--> </div> </div> <div class="gc13v2-genericimage component-base section"> <section class="p-gc13v2-genericimage p-row-gutter p-comp-spacing-bottom "
            data-comp-id="gc13v2Genericimage"
            data-minheight="dynamic"
            data-include-hover-effect="no"
